1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:09,739
The ear can cope with intensities from ten to the minus twelve, the faintest whisper of sound, up to about one watt per square metre, where it starts to hurt.

2
00:00:09,739 --> 00:00:11,809
That is a range of a million million.

3
00:00:11,809 --> 00:00:15,937
A straight scale is hopeless, so we use a logarithmic one.

